    <string name="help_title">TV Settings</string>
    <string name="help_features">* needs Shizuku\n\nApps: filter, sort and search. Running apps show CPU and RAM; the header shows device totals.\n\nSelected app: Details, Actions (launch, app info, view manifest, backup APK, enable or disable, clear data, uninstall, force stop), Permissions, VPN, services and activities. OK on an activity opens its options.\n\nAdvanced: every section collapses. Status, Network, Privacy, Screensaver / Appearance, Location, Mouse Toggle, Home redirect, Install APK and Diagnostics.\n\nHome redirect: Home opens the launch app from the stock home. A second press during the delay stays on stock.\n\nWidget: CPU and RAM for your launcher.</string>
